-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §75 תנאי ההעסקה של מנהלים קיימים שאינם
-- אקדמאיים: a non-academic principal with 1 to 27 years of seniority for pay
-- must complete a degree within 4 years of his school's move to keep the
-- post, and is on the non-academic principals' terms till then; with 28
-- years or more he is on those terms, and §§85(א) and 86 apply if he
-- completes a degree within 4 years (later, by part מט).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `75 תנאי ההעסקה של מנהלים קיימים שאינם אקדמאיים`

DECLARE `non-academic principal's terms` IS ONE OF
    `the non-academic principals' terms, a degree due within 4 years`
    `the non-academic principals' terms`
    `the non-academic principals' terms, with §§85(א) and 86`
    `the non-academic principals' terms, §§85(א) and 86 for the committees of part מט`
    `none under section 75`

-- (ג) names "סעיפים 85 שגיאה! מקור ההפניה לא נמצא.(א) ו - 86", a corpus
-- sic, read as §§85(א) and 86. (ה): the seniority is the one on the
-- school's move.
@ref akn:art_75__para_a akn:art_75__para_b akn:art_75__para_c akn:art_75__para_d akn:art_75__para_e
GIVEN `seniority on the school's move` IS A NUMBER, `years from the school's move to the degree` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `non-academic principal's terms`
DECIDE `the non-academic principal's terms` `seniority on the school's move` `years from the school's move to the degree` IS
    IF `seniority on the school's move` AT LEAST 28
    THEN CONSIDER `years from the school's move to the degree`
         WHEN JUST y THEN IF y AT MOST 4 THEN `the non-academic principals' terms, with §§85(א) and 86`
                          ELSE `the non-academic principals' terms, §§85(א) and 86 for the committees of part מט`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `the non-academic principals' terms`
    ELSE IF `seniority on the school's move` AT LEAST 1
         THEN `the non-academic principals' terms, a degree due within 4 years`
         ELSE `none under section 75`

#ASSERT `the non-academic principal's terms` 20 NOTHING EQUALS `the non-academic principals' terms, a degree due within 4 years`
#ASSERT `the non-academic principal's terms` 28 (JUST 4) EQUALS `the non-academic principals' terms, with §§85(א) and 86`
